{"3869840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashen Vale: Where They Fell", "steam_appid": 3869840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashen Vale: Where They Fell</strong> is a <strong>third-person psychological horror adventure</strong> set deep in the ruins of a cursed Japanese village. You play as <strong>Yuna Sato</strong>, an archaeologist sent to investigate the sudden disappearance of a dig team who unearthed something ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by scattered journals, ghostly visions, and your creeping dread, you’ll uncover what happened the night the village fell — and what now waits beneath. As the line between reality and ritual blurs, you’ll be forced to make choices that shape your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Third-person psychological horror</strong> focused on exploration, story, and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ <strong>Explore a forgotten village</strong> cursed by ritual, blood, and grief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Uncover the past</strong> through environmental storytelling, found recordings, and visions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 <strong>Supernatural encounters</strong> with spirits of the dead and vampiric horrors lurking in the dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔀 <strong>Narrative-driven gameplay</strong> with <strong>choices that affect the story's ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashen Vale: Where They Fell</strong> is a <strong>third-person psychological horror adventure</strong> set deep in the ruins of a cursed Japanese village. You play as <strong>Yuna Sato</strong>, an archaeologist sent to investigate the sudden disappearance of a dig team who unearthed something ancient.</p><p class=\"b